!","jump":"m_ex_soda_twinklingbunny_01_15"},{"id":"m_ex_soda_twinklingbunny_01_11","type":"Speech","speaker":"soda_b","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_soda_twinklingbunny_01_11","text":"T_T","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_soda_twinklingbunny_01_12","type":"Speech","speaker":"soda_b","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_soda_twinklingbunny_01_12","text":"Really? Is it that bad?","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_soda_twinklingbunny_01_13","type":"Self","speaker":null,"key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_soda_twinklingbunny_01_13","text":"Just kidding. You look great.","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_soda_twinklingbunny_01_14","type":"Speech","speaker":"soda_b","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_soda_twinklingbunny_01_14","text":"Oh, thank goodness!","jump":"m_ex_soda_twinklingbunny_01_15"},{"id":"m_ex_soda_twinklingbunny_01_15","type":"Self","speaker":null,"key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_soda_twinklingbunny_01_15","text":"So you've gone from being a maid to a bunny girl, is that it?","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_soda_twinklingbunny_01_16","type":"Speech","speaker":"soda_b","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_soda_twinklingbunny_01_16","text":"That's right! Hehehe!","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_soda_twinklingbunny_01_17","type":"Speech","speaker":"soda_b","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_soda_twinklingbunny_01_17","text":"Which do you prefer, Master?","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_soda_twinklingbunny_01_18","type":"Choice","speaker":null,"key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_soda_twinklingbunny_01_18","text":"Personally, I prefer your original maid uniform.","jump":"m_ex_soda_twinklingbunny_01_20"},{"id":"m_ex_soda_twinklingbunny_01_19","type":"Choice","speaker":null,"key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_soda_twinklingbunny_01_19","text":"Personally, I like the bunny outfit a bit more.","jump":"m_ex_soda_twinklingbunny_01_22"},{"id":"m_ex_soda_twinklingbunny_01_20","type":"Speech","speaker":"soda_b","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_soda_twinklingbunny_01_20","text":"Hehe, I figured you'd say that.","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_soda_twinklingbunny_01_21","type":"Speech","speaker":"soda_b","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_soda_twinklingbunny_01_21","text":"I also think the maid uniform suits me best.","jump":"m_ex_soda_twinklingbunny_01_24"},{"id":"m_ex_soda_twinklingbunny_01_22","type":"Speech","speaker":"soda_b","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_soda_twinklingbunny_01_22","text":"Hehe, if you like it that much,","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_soda_twinklingbunny_01_23","type":"Speech","speaker":"soda_b","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_soda_twinklingbunny_01_23","text":"I'll be sure to wear it more often in the future.","jump":"m_ex_soda_twinklingbunny_01_24"},{"id":"m_ex_soda_twinklingbunny_01_24","type":"Self","speaker":null,"key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_soda_twinklingbunny_01_24","text":"Anything you wear looks good on you, Soda.","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_soda_twinklingbunny_01_25","type":"Speech","speaker":"soda_b","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_soda_twinklingbunny_01_25","text":"Hehe, I'm glad to hear you say that!","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_soda_twinklingbunny_01_26","type":"Speech","speaker":"soda_b","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_soda_twinklingbunny_01_26","text":"Anyways,","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_soda_twinklingbunny_01_27","type":"Speech","speaker":"soda_b","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_soda_twinklingbunny_01_27","text":"I ought to get back to cleaning.","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_soda_twinklingbunny_01_28","type":"Self","speaker":null,"key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_soda_twinklingbunny_01_28","text":"You're still cleaning even after becoming a bunny girl?","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_soda_twinklingbunny_01_29","type":"Speech","speaker":"soda_b","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_soda_twinklingbunny_01_29","text":"Of course!","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_soda_twinklingbunny_01_30","type":"Speech","speaker":"soda_b","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_soda_twinklingbunny_01_30","text":"I may be dressed up like a bunny girl,","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_soda_twinklingbunny_01_31","type":"Speech","speaker":"soda_b","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_soda_twinklingbunny_01_31","text":"but that doesn't change the fact that","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_soda_twinklingbunny_01_32","type":"Speech","speaker":"soda_b","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_soda_twinklingbunny_01_32","text":"I'll always be a maid at heart!","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_soda_twinklingbunny_01_33","type":"Self","speaker":null,"key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_soda_twinklingbunny_01_33","text":"Spoken like a true professional maid.","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_soda_twinklingbunny_01_34","type":"Speech","speaker":"soda_b","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_soda_twinklingbunny_01_34","text":"You betcha!","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_soda_twinklingbunny_01_35","type":"Speech","speaker":"soda_b","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_soda_twinklingbunny_01_35","text":"Hehe!","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_soda_twinklingbunny_01_36","type":"Self","speaker":null,"key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_soda_twinklingbunny_01_36","text":"In that case, could you clean the Commander's Room now?","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_soda_twinklingbunny_01_37","type":"Speech","speaker":"soda_b","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_soda_twinklingbunny_01_37","text":"Sure thing!","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_soda_twinklingbunny_01_38","type":"Speech","speaker":"soda_b","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_soda_twinklingbunny_01_38","text":"I'm on it!","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_soda_twinklingbunny_01_39","type":"Monologue","speaker":null,"key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_soda_twinklingbunny_01_39","text":"There is no response for a while.","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_soda_twinklingbunny_01_40","type":"Speech","speaker":"soda_b","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_soda_twinklingbunny_01_40","text":"Master!","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_soda_twinklingbunny_01_41","type":"Speech","speaker":"soda_b","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_soda_twinklingbunny_01_41","text":"I'm all done!","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_soda_twinklingbunny_01_42","type":"Speech","speaker":"soda_b","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_soda_twinklingbunny_01_42","text":"Hehe.","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_soda_twinklingbunny_01_43","type":"Self","speaker":null,"key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_soda_twinklingbunny_01_43","text":"Huh? No one came into my room.","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_soda_twinklingbunny_01_44","type":"Speech","speaker":"soda_b","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_soda_twinklingbunny_01_44","text":"Eh?","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_soda_twinklingbunny_01_45","type":"Speech","speaker":"soda_b","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_soda_twinklingbunny_01_45","text":"Whaaatttt??","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_soda_twinklingbunny_01_46","type":"Self","speaker":null,"key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_soda_twinklingbunny_01_46","text":"Whose room did you clean?","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_soda_twinklingbunny_01_47","type":"Speech","speaker":"soda_b","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_soda_twinklingbunny_01_47","text":"I... I'm not sure. T_T","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_soda_twinklingbunny_01_48","type":"Self","speaker":null,"key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_soda_twinklingbunny_01_48","text":"Well, it should be okay. If anything, you did someone else a favor.","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_soda_twinklingbunny_01_49","type":"Speech","speaker":"soda_b","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_soda_twinklingbunny_01_49","text":"True that. Anyway, I'll head over to the Commander's Room now.","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_soda_twinklingbunny_01_50","type":"Monologue","speaker":null,"key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_soda_twinklingbunny_01_50","text":"Once again, there is no response from Soda for a while.","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_soda_twinklingbunny_01_51","type":"Monologue","speaker":null,"key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_soda_twinklingbunny_01_51","text":"I think she may have wandered into someone else's room again...","jump":null}],"chat":true}